Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.40,0:00:16.70,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It doesn't get much better than that.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N很难有比这更好的表现了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.70,0:00:21.90,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Composed and flawless from Mirra Andreeva today.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N安德烈娃今天冷静又出色
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.05,0:00:24.23,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}11{\fs68}月{\fs78}10{\fs68}日清晨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.23,0:00:27.07,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}印第安韦尔斯年终总决赛小组赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.07,0:00:28.65,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}第一次站上这个舞台
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.65,0:00:32.37,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}安德烈娃怎样把{\fs78}6{\fs68}次危机全部守住？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.05,0:00:36.64,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}一边是{\fs78}19{\fs68}岁的年终总决赛新人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.64,0:00:40.14,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}一边是{\fs78}2018{\fs68}年的冠军斯维托丽娜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.14,0:00:42.01,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}安德烈娃要先拿下的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.01,0:00:43.94,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}是自己的第一场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.05,0:00:47.21,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}首盘{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.21,0:00:50.01,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}斯维托丽娜的双误送出破发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.01,0:00:51.17,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}领先后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.17,0:00:53.32,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}安德烈娃得把自己的发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.32,0:00:55.34,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}一局一局守住
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.40,0:01:11.10,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N噢！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.20,0:01:15.75,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's too good!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N太出色了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.90,0:01:19.60,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} 发球胜盘局 却遇到破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.60,0:01:21.29,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}这一次的底线拉锯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.29,0:01:23.77,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}她能先把危机挡回去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.15,0:01:53.10,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Strikes first in Indian Wells.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N在印第安韦尔斯先赢一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.20,0:01:55.07,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}先赢一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.07,0:01:58.27,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}第二盘 双方还在底线正反手拉锯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.27,0:02:00.82,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}安德烈娃继续争对手的发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.82,0:02:02.85,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}把优势往前推
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.05,0:02:18.95,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, come on! Take that!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N哇 接这球吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.10,0:02:23.80,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}从首盘最后一局起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.80,0:02:25.79,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}她最终连赢{\fs78}7{\fs68}局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.79,0:02:27.55,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}但第二盘{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}时
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.55,0:02:30.43,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}斯维托丽娜还在给她出难题
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.85,0:02:36.65,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Yes!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N漂亮！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.65,0:02:38.45,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Ouch.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.70,0:02:43.05,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}最后一局 {\fs78}4{\fs68}个破发点全部化解
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.05,0:02:45.50,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}对手的机会过去了 这一次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.50,0:02:47.88,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}轮到安德烈娃拿赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.85,0:03:05.15,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It doesn't get much better than that.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N很难有比这更好的表现了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.15,0:03:10.35,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Composed and flawless from Mirra Andreeva today.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N安德烈娃今天冷静又出色
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.35,0:03:15.95,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Against an out-of-sorts Elina Svitolina.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N面对状态欠佳的斯维托丽娜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.95,0:03:19.95,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Especially on serve today, the world number six just couldn't find the magic.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N世界第六今天尤其发球不顺
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.95,0:03:23.15,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But Andreeva could. She wasn't broken at all.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N安德烈娃却守住全部发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.15,0:03:27.55,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And found plenty more besides on return.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N接发球时 也不断争到机会
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.55,0:03:31.55,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's a very good introduction to the WTA Finals for the world number three.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N世界第三的年终初登场足够出色
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.80,0:03:35.29,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}她握拳 笑了 又举手向看台致意
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.29,0:03:37.14,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}第一次来到这个舞台
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.14,0:03:40.32,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}她用一场胜利 和它打了招呼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.80,0:03:43.75,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.75,0:03:45.57,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}下一场对萨巴伦卡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.57,0:03:47.06,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}去年在这里的决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.06,0:03:48.96,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}安德烈娃赢过她
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.96,0:03:51.66,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}这一次 还能再赢吗？
